      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Generous Distraction",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Dresh can use the promise of wealth to distract her foes. When she succeeds or critically succeeds on a Deception check to Feint against a target within 30 feet, the target is Off-Guard against her ranged attacks as well as her melee Strikes.",
