      "name": "Silver Shower Shot",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\n---\n\nEffect Dresh throws 2d6 silver pieces into the air, potentially distracting her target. Dresh makes a Deception check to Feint against a creature within 30 feet that can see her and which she can see. If her flintlock pistol is loaded, Dresh then makes a ranged flintlock pistol Strike against that target.",
